# Build output. Not committed: `prepare` rebuilds it during `npm install`, including when this repo
# is installed as a git dependency, so a consumer always gets artifacts matching the pinned commit.
# Committing them meant they could drift from src/ -- and they did, in 9 of 25 consecutive commits.
